<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to the Task Manager App</h1>
    <p>This Task Manager app, built with ASP.NET Core MVC, allows users to efficiently manage their tasks. It provides a
        simple, yet powerful interface for creating, editing, and deleting tasks. Whether you're a developer, student,
        or professional, this app can help you stay organized and keep track of important activities.</p>

    <p>Key features include:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Easy task creation and management</li>
        <li>Mark tasks as completed or pending</li>
        <li>User authentication for secure access</li>
        <li>Responsive design optimized for various devices</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Start managing your tasks today and boost your productivity with this simple but effective tool!</p>
</div>
